    "She did the same thing the next day, and the day after that. Her playing did not suddenly become beautiful. But little by little the door-like sound became softer, and one afternoon she realized that she had played the whole piece without stopping. {5|Now, to her surprise, she found herself looking forward to rehearsals.}",
    "The winter concert was held in the school hall in December. Wren's hands shook as she walked onto the stage, but once the music started she forgot about the audience. When it was over, she noticed that she had not made a single serious mistake. Her parents waved wildly from the third row.",
